{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38930","headline":"长安道中有作 · 杜荀鹤","name":"长安道中有作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"回头不忍看羸僮，一路行人我最穷。\n马迹蹇於槐影里，钓船抛在月明中。\n帽檐晓滴淋蝉露，衫袖时飘卷鴈风。\n子细寻思底模样，腾腾又过玉关东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38930.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38930","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}